      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "Discussion",
      "contextAfter": "The system calls the [`didReorder`](uicollectionviewdiffabledatasource-9tqpa/reorderinghandlers-swift.struct/didreorder.md) handler after a reordering transaction ([`NSDiffableDataSourceTransaction`](nsdiffabledatasourcetransaction-swift.struct.md)) occurs, so you can update your data backing store with information about the changes.",
